```
{"name": "John Doe", "age": "30", "hobbies": ["reading", null, {"name": "gardening", "participants": [{"firstname": "Alice", "lastname": "Smith"}, {"firstname": null, "lastname": "Johnson"}]}]}
```

In the cleaned JSON data, the age field is now a string and any null values or objects with missing firstname or lastname fields in the hobbies field are preserved.

